cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite both the dataset and the
  originating article.
title: >-
  San Francisco Planning Commission Public Comment Data, 1998-2026
authors:
  - family-names: Sahn
    given-names: Alexander
type: dataset
repository-code: https://github.com/alexandersahn/sf-planning-public-comment
abstract: >-
  Agenda items, outcomes, and individual public comments (speaker name,
  polarity, comment summary, speaker role) parsed from every San Francisco
  Planning Commission meeting's minutes, January 1998 to present, joined to
  San Francisco Planning Department project records. Extends and rebuilds
  the data used in Sahn (2025), "Public Comment and Public Policy."
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: Public Comment and Public Policy
  authors:
    - family-names: Sahn
      given-names: Alexander
  journal: American Journal of Political Science
  year: 2025
  volume: 69
  issue: 2
  start: 685
  end: 700
  doi: 10.1111/ajps.12900
